WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.680
I am about sixteen hundred years

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.690
old. And I have not rusted.

3
00:00:06.314 --> 00:00:08.694
I stand in Delhi's Qutb complex,

4
00:00:08.694 --> 00:00:09.581
at Mehrauli.

5
00:00:09.581 --> 00:00:12.514
Seven metres tall, more than six

6
00:00:12.514 --> 00:00:14.514
tonnes. A king named Chandra,

7
00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.574
usually identified as

8
00:00:16.574 --> 00:00:18.954
Chandragupta the Second, had me

9
00:00:18.954 --> 00:00:19.754
raised.

10
00:00:20.085 --> 00:00:22.685
Smiths forged me from pieces of

11
00:00:22.685 --> 00:00:25.225
wrought iron, welded together by

12
00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:28.215
hand, in the days of the Guptas.

13
00:00:28.646 --> 00:00:31.346
My oldest verse, in Sanskrit,

14
00:00:31.346 --> 00:00:33.466
says the king has left this

15
00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.786
earth, yet remains on it through

16
00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:37.446
the memory of his fame.

17
00:00:37.446 --> 00:00:40.466
I have stayed a little longer

18
00:00:40.466 --> 00:00:42.076
than most memories.

19
00:00:42.719 --> 00:00:44.919
Where did I first stand?

20
00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:46.979
Some scholars say near the

21
00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:48.779
Udayagiri caves.

22
00:00:48.779 --> 00:00:51.019
Nobody is sure when I was moved

23
00:00:51.019 --> 00:00:52.009
to Delhi.

24
00:00:52.564 --> 00:00:54.024
Why don't I rust?

25
00:00:54.024 --> 00:00:55.884
There is a lot of phosphorus in

26
00:00:55.884 --> 00:00:56.764
my iron.

27
00:00:56.764 --> 00:00:59.024
With tiny bits of slag, and

28
00:00:59.024 --> 00:01:01.264
Delhi's wet and dry spells, it

29
00:01:01.264 --> 00:01:03.404
forms a thin protective film.

30
00:01:03.404 --> 00:01:05.324
A self made raincoat.

31
00:01:05.324 --> 00:01:08.664
R. Balasubramaniam of IIT Kanpur

32
00:01:08.664 --> 00:01:10.174
explains it.

33
00:01:11.621 --> 00:01:12.561
For GS1 and Prelims:

34
00:01:12.561 --> 00:01:14.841
the Delhi iron pillar, Gupta

35
00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:18.341
period, king Chandra, and a rust

36
00:01:18.341 --> 00:01:20.121
resistant film built on

37
00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:21.771
phosphorus rich iron.

38
00:01:23.092 --> 00:01:25.972
Sixteen centuries, one thin

39
00:01:25.972 --> 00:01:29.002
film, and a verse about fame.
